<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6023] Kylin5 model cannot be renamed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6023</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The rename interface in the UI submits successfully and returns a success response, but the model name remains unchanged.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
